Optional you can run a command to clear the dns cache which is; sudo killall -HUP mDNSResponder

Resolver File

to enable users to browse to fileshares we will need to add in a resolver file to the mac

Open Terminal and execute the following commands

Navigate to the resolver folder



cd /etc/resolver
if the folder doesnt exist execute command



sudo mkdir /etc/Resolver
Once the folder has been created type the following command to open the text editor



sudo nano
Copy the following into the terminal window



domain intranet.gbp.co.uk
search intranet.gbp.co.uk
nameserver 10.150.3.13
nameserver 10.150.3.14
nameserver 10.57.1.11
nameserver 10.57.1.12
Press Control + O to save

Type in the filename “intranet.gbp.co.uk.local” > press enter

Press Control + X to close the file

